1); font-size: 11pt;\">/</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(12, 12, 255); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 경영학과</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">평점평균&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">3.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">이상 및&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">750</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">점 이상</span>(동일 어학성적 인정_</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt;\">붙임파일 공인외국어시험 환산표 참고)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 36.4pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -36.4pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all;\"><a style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">7.&nbsp;</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 23.4667px;\">지원 불가능한 경우</span><br style=\"color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-family: NanumBarunGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 23.4667px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. LINC 3.0&nbsp;참여학과(전공) 4학기 이상 이수하지 아닌 자(복수전공 인정 불가)</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나.&nbsp;휴학생, 2024년&nbsp;2월 졸업 예정자</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다.&nbsp;여권 미소지자:&nbsp;여권 소지자만 가능(2023. 12. 25.(월)&nbsp;기준 유효기간&nbsp;6개월 이상)</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라.&nbsp;당해연도 동일 또는 유사프로그램(교환학생,&nbsp;해외인턴십&nbsp; 등)&nbsp;수혜자는 제외될 수 있음</span></span><br><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">8.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">신청서 접수 및 제출서류 안내</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">모집기한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: ~ 2023. 12. 7.(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">도착분까지 마감</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">제출서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">참가신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">양식 붙임파일 참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">및 각종 증빙서류 스캔본(성적증명서, 어학점수 등) PDF파일 스캔본</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">제출방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">메일접수 또는 방문(산학협력관 501호)접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">편한 방법으로 택</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 255); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1)</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 4)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">메일 접수처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13px;\"><font color=\"#393f48\" face=\"맑은 고딕, Malgun Gothic, 돋움, Dotum, 굴림, Gulim, Arial, Helvetica, Helvetica Neue, Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">talents</span></font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 5)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">방문 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">산학협력관&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">층&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">501</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">호 산학교육원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 6)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">학생 선발 절차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">: 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">차 서류전형</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">최종선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">추후 필요시 면접 개별연락 절차등 변동가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">9.</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">지원사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">선발학생 혜택</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">현지 연수교육비 전액 무료</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">항공료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">여행자보험</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">현지숙소 등 지원</span><br><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">10.</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">학생 참가경비&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">: 1인 3,000,000원(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-family: 굴림; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11pt;\">삼백만원)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; text-indent: -48.5333px; font-weight: 300; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">선발 학생이 학교로 납부하여야 하는 금액이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">선발자에 한하여 추후 세부 내용 공지</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">체류기간 내 식대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">문화탐방비는 개인 부담하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#474747\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; text-indent: -48.5333px; font-weight: 300; font-size: 11pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">총비용&nbsp;1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">인당 13,176,000원중 학생분담&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">3,000,000</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">원,&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">LINC3.0 사업비 지원금 10,176,000원</span><font color=\"#474747\" face=\"굴림\"><br></font><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">11.</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">유의사항</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">프로그램 참여 후 최종 선발이 된 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">추후&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">LINC3.0</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">주관 우수성과 확산 프로그램에 반드시 참여</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">프로그램 종료 후&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">월~2024년11월</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;중 교내에서 사후 결과보고회&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">참여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">상세일정 추후 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><br><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">12.</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">기타 안내사항&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">개인노트북 필수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">현지 프로젝트 개인 노트북으로 수행 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><br><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">13.</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">문의사항&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">: LINC3.0사업단&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">산학교육원 배수영</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 11pt;\">(054-478-6730)</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
